d the gate) with `$HOME/.dotnet` on its PATH, or approve `~/.dotnet/dotnet` here and I'll build and run the tests. Then re-run the gate with `--stage test`.","ttft_ms":4080,"type":"result","duration_ms":44581,"uuid":"30741700-ca64-4872-b9d0-94f99a3e4e6b","ttft_stream_ms":3418,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":3418,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
